"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-top"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-entry-number"},"children":["04"]},{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-evidence grade-a"},"children":["Evidence"," ","A"]}]},{"tag":"h1","props":{"lang":"en"},"children":["Don’t accept candy or snacks from strangers, don’t drink beverages left unattended, and don’t take e‑cigarette cartridges handed to you by others"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"lang":"en","className":"life-entry-summary"},"children":["Today’s illicit drugs no longer look like typical drugs. “High‑inducing” e‑cigarettes laced with synthetic cannabinoids can be tinted and flavored to match ordinary e‑cigarettes, and they are deliberately offered to people in bars, KTVs, and hotels. Those who trick others into using them face 10–15 days of detention and fines of 1,000–5,000 yuan. Anyone who is deceived into using them also gets detained for 10–15 days. Always replace any drink that has been left unattended."]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-impact"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["Cost"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["No cost at all. Never accept anything offered by others. I…"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["Benefit"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["Since July 1, 2021, synthetic cannabinoids have been regulated as a whole class of controlled substances. They…"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-actions","aria-label":"Mark: Don’t accept candy or snacks from strangers, don’t drink beverages left unattended, and don’t take e‑cigarette cartridges handed to you by others"},"children":[{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action done","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap"